     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: pangloss<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=487398<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>Fix committed to trunk (r7172). Note that to eliminate the shutdown error message, the system property org.apache.catalina.loader.WebappClassLoader.ENABLE_CLEAR_REFERENCES must be set to false. This is not set by default, but the Tomcat upgrade now allows the system property to be set.</p>",
